        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Write the Prompt, Then Make the Image\n\nTurns a plain-language idea into an image prompt, then generates the image. The written prompt stays visible, so you can correct it instead of guessing.\n\n**How it works:** Type the idea into \"1 Idea\". \"2 Write the prompt\" writes one sentence naming subject, lighting, lens and palette. It goes to \"3 Generate\" for a square image and to \"4 Prompt used\", and the picture appears in \"5 Image\".\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"2 Write the prompt\" and \"3 Generate\", then change aspect_ratio on \"3 Generate\" to 16:9."
        },
